Date:   Mon Oct 19 21:56:50 2026 -0500

    P136 step 1: compiler — definitions from every element, \circ, figures.json rows, canonical-unit match
    
    1a D1 dropped: definitions from any element, deduped on the normalized term (term,
       else label_as_printed, else the first mention), evidence joined.
    1b normalize(): \circ / ^\circ -> °.
    1c figures.json: a simulated curve -> entity + model row + its own conditions
       (model_input); a measured curve -> observation + conditions under the specimen's
       measurement activity; a set -> its conditions as settings and one comparison
       (kind, varied; purpose = the set's first curve row, members = the curve
       entities). Parents through pass-0 introduced_in, else logged.
    1d gold diff and audit T5: values in the quantity's canonical unit (canon).
    audit.py: figure rows count as records of their elements; --unit for report files.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

